<title>ISRAEL: AGAN Q2 EPS $0.37 VS $0.36.</title>
<headline>AGAN Q2 EPS $0.37 VS $0.36.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agan Chemical Manufacturers Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of dollars except EPS)</p>
<p>			   Q2 97    Q2 96	6-MTH 97    6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  77,060   52,422     179,217     140,111</p>
<p>Operating Profit	8,190    6,323	22,023	20,525</p>
<p>Net Profit		5,539    5,435	15,702	16,961</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share    0.37     0.36	  1.04	  1.13</p>
<p>($1 = 3.53 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
